# Lab 07 – Model Evaluation

## Overview
This lab focused on evaluating machine learning models after they have been trained.

## What I Learned
- How to use accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score
- How to read a confusion matrix
- Why accuracy alone does not always explain model performance

## Tools Used
- Python
- scikit-learn
- matplotlib

## Reflection
This lab helped me understand that evaluating a model requires looking at multiple metrics, not just accuracy.
